✔ Luego, si están disponibles: python3 -m ruff check ., python3 manage.py test
✔ Enforcing: Red→Green TDD Verifier & N+1 Heuristic`,
  },
  {
    id: "astro",
    name: "Astro",
    lang: "TypeScript",
    icon: "🚀",
    detection: "astro.config.mjs",
    runner: "npm test / Playwright",
    gate: "node tools/audit.js",
    rules: "CWV LCP Priority + OpenGraph + Touch Targets",
    snippet: `// Detected: Astro Islands Architecture
// Initialized: .cursor/rules/*.mdc, CLAUDE.md
// Audit Engine: Node.js pattern-based guards
✔ Hook instalado: .githooks/pre-commit (.husky/pre-commit si Husky ya ejecuta los hooks)
