✔ Luego, si están disponibles: npx astro check, npx vitest run
✔ Enforcing: Zero-JS Defaults & 44x44px Touch Targets`,
  },
  {
    id: "rails",
    name: "Ruby on Rails",
    lang: "Ruby",
    icon: "💎",
    detection: "Gemfile (rails)",
    runner: "bundle exec rspec",
    gate: "node tools/audit.js",
    rules: "Custom Rules + RuboCop / Brakeman (when installed)",
